main.py — FastAPI Orchestrator
===============================

Pipeline for each TradingView alert:
  1. Receive webhook  → verify secret
  2. Validate symbol  → must be in ALLOWED_SYMBOLS
  3. Fetch live quote + historical indicators (yfinance)
  4. Pre-flight risk evaluation (risk_manager)
  5. Claude AI analysis (claude_analyzer)
  6. Send formatted Telegram alert (telegram_bot)

Endpoints:
  POST /webhook/tradingview   ← TradingView sends here
  GET  /analyze/{symbol}      ← Manual on-demand analysis
  GET  /health                ← Railway / uptime health check
  GET  /                      ← API info

Run locally:
  uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000

Deploy (Railway):
  Set all .env vars in Railway dashboard → push code
"""

